source reviewed","value","2026-10-20","image","gameplay","The creator’s rifle-combat screenshot.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/astra-floor-ai.webp","alt","Astra Floor rifle combat against a zombie wave, with health, ammunition and wave counters.","https://github.com/MartinDelophy/awesome-gpt-6-astra/issues/96","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","Creator-attributed clients / models (not inferred from related tools)",[87,88],"ChatGPT","Antigravity","Related resources",[93],"resourceIds","section",{"_58":94,"_25":95},"Three.js","/resources/threejs/","Creator evidence",[99],"evidence",{"_58":100,"_25":76,"_101":102},"Read the author’s division of AI work","note","The repository owner’s submission distinguishes Astra from Antigravity work. The README also credits both tools; no full conversation archive is supplied.","Source contents","complete project","Project source",[107],{"_58":108,"_25":109,"_101":110},"Open the complete FPS project","https://github.com/BEROCHLU/astrafloor","Game implementation, procedural models, bundled textures/music and tests. Node.js 22.13+; npm install then npm run dev. Third-party texture credits are documented separately.","Access type","playable","demo","Play or run",[116],{"_58":117,"_25":118,"_101":119},"Play Astra Floor","https://astrafloor.berochlu.workers.dev/","Desktop WebGL, keyboard and mouse. Wait for INITIALIZING to finish, choose a difficulty, then DEPLOY. WASD moves, mouse aims/fires, R reloads, Q heals, G throws a grenade, and V uses melee. Runs are not saved. The in-app browser could not capture the mouse during review; a normal desktop browser is recommended.","Game platform","Browser","Guide format","disclosure","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[127],{"_58":128,"_25":76,"_101":-7},"Read the creator’s AI development disclosure","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[133,134,135,136],"Choose Normal difficulty and enter the first wave.","Read the creator’s architecture and model disclosure.","Inspect procedural weapons, enemies and audio implementation.","Tune one weapon or enemy and verify a wave and shop transition.","AI workflow / foundation context","BEROCHLU credits GPT-6 Astra with much of the architecture, procedural 3D generation and Web Audio synthesis. Antigravity 2.0 supplied other implementation and iterative refinement. The disclosure does not claim a single-prompt build.","aiUse","guidance","Creation category","AI-assisted (creator attribution)","category","provenance","Track","3D","track","metadata","Engine","Three.js · TypeScript (React UI)","engine","lead","3d","ai-assisted",[133,134,135,136],{"_58":128,"_25":76,"_17":123},{"_58":117,"_25":118,"_17":112,"_101":119},{"_58":108,"_25":109,"_162":163,"_101":110},{"_58":100,"_25":76,"_101":102},[161],"threejs","scope","complete-project",{"_165":166},"documents",{"_167":168,"_169":170},"en",[172,176,177,178,175,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,174,211,173,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229],"zh",[171,172,173,174,175],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","com